#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide walks through building a WASM plugin for Language Check using "
"Go and TinyGo. The same principles apply to any language with an [Extism "
"PDK](https://extism.org/docs/write-a-plugin/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:7
msgid ""
"Language Check loads WASM plugins via [Extism](https://extism.org/). Each"
" plugin exports a `check` function that receives prose text and returns "
"diagnostics. Plugins run in a sandboxed WebAssembly environment — they "
"cannot access the filesystem, network, or host memory."
msgstr ""

