#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:50
msgid ""
"Diagnostics from plugins are treated identically to built-in engine "
"results — `suggestions` automatically appear in the SpeedFix panel, inlay"
" hints, inline ghost text completions, and code actions. The first "
"suggestion in the array is used as the preferred quick-fix. An empty "
"string `\"\"` suggestion means \"remove the matched text\", and "
"suggestions prefixed with `Insert \"...\"` insert text at the diagnostic "
"end position rather than replacing."
msgstr ""

