#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:235
msgid "Debugging"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:237
msgid ""
"**Extism errors**: The host logs plugin errors at `warn` level. Enable "
"tracing in VS Code or use `--trace` on the CLI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:238
msgid ""
"**JSON parse failures**: If your output isn't valid JSON, the host "
"silently returns empty diagnostics. Test your JSON serialization in unit "
"tests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:239
msgid ""
"**Byte offsets**: Offsets must be valid UTF-8 byte positions in the input"
" text. Off-by-one errors here cause garbled diagnostic ranges."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:240
msgid ""
"**Empty output**: Return `[]` (empty JSON array), not an empty string, "
"when there are no issues."
msgstr ""

